{"id":"wb-4-165","name":"南堂","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"宣武门天主堂","text":"宣武门天主堂是位于中国北京市西城区前门西大街141号的天主教教堂，也是北京最早设立的天主教教堂，俗称南堂或南天主堂。始建于1605年，现行的三层巴洛克建筑建于1904年。曾作为天主教北京教区的主教座堂。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%AE%A3%E6%AD%A6%E9%97%A8%E5%A4%A9%E4%B8%BB%E5%A0%82","revisionId":95077436,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=95077436","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/263878ca7b72117cdd21c88c.jpg","title":"Beijinglifepic3.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Beijinglifepic3.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c6/Beijinglifepic3.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"alexandrine_chan","license":"CC BY-SA 2.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0","caption":"Cathedral in Beijing","width":320,"height":427}}